  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "c_line1",
   "x": 75,
   "y": 1045,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 36,
   "text": "/server/<file> (non-script) \u2192 serve_static_blocking: Range/206 + libmagic MIME \u2014 no admission permit, no VM, no engine\n(serves the operator's docroot, never imgroot \u2014 the file_preflight-guarded binary download is /{prefix}/{id}/file, band A)",
   "originalText": "/server/<file> (non-script) \u2192 serve_static_blocking: Range/206 + libmagic MIME \u2014 no admission permit, no VM, no engine\n(serves the operator's docroot, never imgroot \u2014 the file_preflight-guarded binary download is /{prefix}/{id}/file, band A)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
